OL,3,GNEWSAI thought my children would grow
OL,4,Aup without me after I got sepsis
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoppy Gibson had only just given birth
OL,7,Fwhen she thought she was going to die.
OL,9,FEleven years ago, while pregnant with
OL,10,Fher second baby, she developed pain in
OL,11,Fher side which doctors thought could be
OL,12,Fthe baby putting pressure on her lung.
OL,14,FDoctors then feared Poppy, from
OL,15,FRayleigh in Essex, was ill with
OL,16,Fpneumonia and decided to induce her at
OL,17,F36 weeks.
